{"title":"RFK's AI hallucinations","link":"https://www.garbageday.email/p/rfk-s-ai-hallucinations","date":1748628586000,"content":"<div><div><p><i>Welcome to Garbage Weekend. It’s the internet garbage you know and love, but in a format that’s easier to read while you try and avoid getting bird flu.</i></p><div><img src=\"https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/uploads/asset/file/dcf62afd-2973-45e4-af21-9f388db68d67/GettyImages-2216564429.jpg?t=1748617975\" /><div><span><p>(Photo by Chip Somodevilla/Getty Images)</p></span></div></div><p>This week, Elon Musk's <a href=\"https://www.reuters.com/world/us/elon-musk-leaving-trump-administration-white-house-official-confirms-2025-05-29/?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=rfk-s-ai-hallucinations\" target=\"_blank\">political influence</a> faced a similar \"<a href=\"https://apnews.com/article/spacex-starship-elon-musk-moon-mars-5f02ab8e4b794e518fe99905adaa7471?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=rfk-s-ai-hallucinations\" target=\"_blank\">rapid unscheduled disassembly</a>\" to his rockets. Musk is in the process of leaving his <a href=\"https://www.wired.com/story/fired-doge-staffer-who-is-in-charge/?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=rfk-s-ai-hallucinations\" target=\"_blank\">nebulous official position</a>, though it probably won't get him out of <a href=\"https://www.nytimes.com/2025/05/30/us/elon-musk-drugs-children-trump.html?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=rfk-s-ai-hallucinations\" target=\"_blank\">his allegedly permanent K-hole</a>, or stop his Department of Government Efficiency (DOGE). Maybe the only way to fight stupid meme acronyms is with stupid meme acronyms — just <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2025/may/29/trump-always-chickens-out-taco-investors-narrative?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=rfk-s-ai-hallucinations\" target=\"_blank\">keep saying “TACO”</a> and it might become a department too. That's a better plan than we're hearing from Robert F. Kennedy Jr., whose seems to have used <a href=\"https://nymag.com/intelligencer/article/did-rfks-crew-use-ai-to-write-error-filled-maha-report.html?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=rfk-s-ai-hallucinations\" target=\"_blank\">AI hallucinations as sources</a> in a new report. \"Ask not what your country can do for you, because as an AI language model...\"</p><p>Oh well, here’s some fun stuff…</p><ul><li><p><a href=\"https://bsky.app/profile/robmesure.bsky.social/post/3lqcn6kq5oc26?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=rfk-s-ai-hallucinations\" target=\"_blank\">Logged out of my toothbrush</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://x.com/JoJoFromJerz/status/1927929328592973880?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=rfk-s-ai-hallucinations\" target=\"_blank\">FBI Director Kash Patel on a big chair</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Mt5z4IkD-qE&amp;utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=rfk-s-ai-hallucinations\" target=\"_blank\">Good Andor edit</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://x.com/Adverse56/status/1921226406366724495?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=rfk-s-ai-hallucinations\" target=\"_blank\">A good AI rebuttal</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://www.tumblr.com/despazito/783576849336926208?source=share&amp;utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=rfk-s-ai-hallucinations\" target=\"_blank\">Buddy the vape dog</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://husbandjoel.tumblr.com/post/784274048264912897/tower-fics-are-so-back-baby?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=rfk-s-ai-hallucination